WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.470
Let's add a non-train item.

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:10.060
Here is my photo. It's a 1953 Van Dyke Seamstress

3
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:14.110
mock-up of a sewing machine. Let's go to the app.

4
00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:19.170
Add to My Collection.

5
00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.270
Paper Item.

6
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:30.190
It's a drawing or blueprint. It's a 1953 Van Dyke Lionel

7
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.020
Seamstress mock-up.

8
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.060
You can name this whatever you want here.

9
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.800
Hit Next. Here's the year.

10
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:49.440
It's in really good shape. Hit Next. I believe it's worth $750.

11
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.450
I don't remember what I paid for it individually, or when I got it.

12
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.380
I'm going to put framed

13
00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:02.440
on wall.

14
00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.330
Next.

15
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:09.700
I'm going to add a photo from Google Photos.

16
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.320
Slide down. There it is. It's a terrible picture,

17
00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.020
but that's okay. We can fix that.

18
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.260
We let it load, and we hit Crop.

19
00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.080
First thing we'll do is hit Straighten.

20
00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.820
So I'll come in here and put the dots on the corners.

21
00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:36.810
This will help make the picture look a lot better.

22
00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:40.150
Pretty close. I want to straighten it.

23
00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:46.560
Now I'm going to narrow things in.

24
00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.890
I don't like showing the white. As you can see, I need to tilt it just a bit.

25
00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.310
Bring it down like that.

26
00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.410
Hit Apply.

27
00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.920
There it is. It does look a lot better.

28
00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.130
Hit Next. I can make whatever edits

29
00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.660
I need to make. I'm going to hit Save.

30
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.220
And then you can come here and review the details.

